doc:    "`--param derives=1` derives only `Equal`, and the `probe` every enum chunk emitted called `s.show(ctx)` regardless — so the corpus referred to a method the type no longer had. The second half of the same mistake as the empty trait list: `derives` moved what is derived without moving what is called. Fixed by asking `derives_trait` whether `Show` is reached, and allocating through `str.format` when it is not, so the probe still needs the `C: Allocator` its signature declares."
property: "generated"
status: FIXED
